{"id":"70714818ed137ea4","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-canonical-truth.md","title":"GL Canonical Truth Lemma","display":"lem-gl-canonical-truth — GL Canonical Truth Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-canonical-truth","aliases":["89-lem-gl-canonical-truth"],"display":"lem-gl-canonical-truth — GL Canonical Truth Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","[[89-lem-canonical-truth]]","[[89-lem-gl-normal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-canonical-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-canonical-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-canonical-truth — GL Canonical Truth Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f068c38418e21f2\" href=\"?note=6f068c38418e21f2\" title=\"89-df-gl-canonical-model\">89-df-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ba20ee86fa7998c\" href=\"?note=5ba20ee86fa7998c\" title=\"89-lem-canonical-truth\">89-lem-canonical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccac24cdfa254e90\" href=\"?note=ccac24cdfa254e90\" title=\"89-lem-gl-normal\">89-lem-gl-normal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\">\\(\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 是一致正规逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 87–88；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>在一般典范真值引理中取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(L=\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。盒的负向证据由一般典范后继见证承担，包含没有盒前提的空列表情况；局部世界假设无需且不允许任意必然化。结论只针对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(V_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>，不宣称典范框架在所有赋值下验证 GL。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-canonical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"5ba20ee86fa7998c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-canonical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-normal","status":"resolved","id":"ccac24cdfa254e90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-normal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\nA\\in S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A.","display":true},{"tex":"L=\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"V_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false}],"bytes":1152,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-452","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-canonical-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["6f068c38418e21f2","5ba20ee86fa7998c","ccac24cdfa254e90"]}